  "activeProfileDescription": "Phase 3.2.1 (03.2.1-01): adapter-level cases. activeProfile is the profile the registry pointer names; its declaration comes from the catalog (config/rag/embedding-model-languages.json), never from the case. database unreachable means the active profile cannot be read: the app checks the default profile and reports verifiedAgainstActiveProfile false. The script entry points never read the pointer, so they see activeProfile as the default profile when the database is reachable and report false.",
